00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:54.080
These days, no one can keep up with&nbsp;
the endless stream of new books,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:58.600
movies, or knowledge — nevermind&nbsp;
catch up on all of history.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:04.480
But Imprint condenses these lessons into&nbsp;
